Who Are You?
============

Find your role below:

* Systems Student & Learner - Exploring low-level OS internals from scratch
* Academic Researcher - Studying kernel architecture and Rust safety contracts
* Device Driver Developer - Writing drivers for hardware and block interfaces
* AI Coding Assistant - LLMs and AI-powered development tools

